ust over 3,000 calls on our hotline a year for pretty close to a decade and there\u2019s been a steady increase and this year we\u2019re expecting close to 7,000 calls.\" Sondra Miller said. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/7HB8aqnyob","media":null,"username":"clevelandrcc","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":48,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1010207085890547712","date":1529687112000,"rawContent":"If you need support or a listening ear, Cleveland Rape Crisis Center Advocates are available 24\/7. Text or call (216) 619-6192 or (440) 423-2020. #MeToo https:\/\/t.co\/7HB8aqnyob","media":null,"username":"clevelandrcc","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":9.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":49,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":9.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1011627535027855361","date":1530025774000,"rawContent":"\"If society is to find its way to a post-#MeToo future, parents, teachers, and community members need to build a culture of boyhood that fosters empathy, communication, caretaking, and cooperation.\" https:\/\/t.co\/68RSOO51cl","media":null,"username":"clevelandrcc","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":7.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":0,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":50,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":7.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1015732349890367488","date":1531004438000,"rawContent":"\"While focus on sexual assault